[[forest]]:
{{set "encounter" (random (array "wolf" "deer" "nothing"))}}
You walk deeper into the forest.

{{#if encounter = "wolf"}}
A wolf howls nearby. You'd better be quick.
{{else if encounter = "deer"}}
A deer looks up at you, then bounds away.
{{else}}
All is quiet.
{{/if}}

[[Keep walking]](forest), or [[go home]](home).

[[home]]:
@end
You head home, and put the kettle on.
